The annual-report application adds local PDF extraction and source-page
rendering, financial review and comparison, a restricted native tool bridge,
opt-in model interpretation, export, tests, and product documentation.
The framework's original authorship is not attributed to this application's
maintainers. Original framework documentation is retained in
README.openharness.md and README.openharness.zh-CN.md.

Public annual reports and other third-party reference material are identified
in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. The MIT license for code does not purport to grant
rights to those third-party documents.
